<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/32/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is authorised of a sum not exceeding Ringgit Malaysia five hundred and sixty-two million six hundred and fourteen thousand and four hundred (RM562,614,400) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services specified in the Schedule for the service of the year 1994, not provided for or not f u l ly provided for by the Supply Act 1994, Supplementary Supply (1993 and 1994) Act 1994 and the Supplementary Supply (1994) Act 1994."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/32/eng@> .
