<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/32/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The said sum is appropriated for the purposes specified in the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/32/eng@> .
